      "mergedPostDetails": "Minimum avatar performance doesnt get saved into Group Instance Default settings, the rest (region, queue, etc) does get saved.\n\nPreparation steps:\n\n1. Open VRChat Open Beta\n\n2. Go to worlds and select a world\n\n3. Click Create Instance\n\n4. Click Group option\n\n5. Click Group Public or something\n\n6. Select the Minimum Avatar Performance \n\n7. Select a different Region, enable the Instance Queue and age verification\n\n8. set the \"set as group instance default\" to on\n\n9. click \"Create Instance\"\n\n10. Do not join the instance and just click X\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Now click the Create Instance button again\n\n2. Select Group option again\n\nNow see that Region and instance queue are the same as previous instance.\n\nHowever the avatar rating isnt saved.\n\n(also age gated isnt saved. Unsure if thats by design)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1832] Minimum avatar performance doesnt get saved into Group Instance Default settings",
